{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If a visible object is found, approach it, grasp it, check its properties, perform specific task, and return it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectGrabbed    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectColor    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ReturnObject    />",
